 "_about": "The approved engineering set-up (CK-1, founder asks A151 and A154, 17 Nov 2026). Owned by the tech lead: a change to the set-up is approved first, then this file gets a new version and a change_log row in the same PR as the change. tools/conformance-check.py compares origin/main with it (lists compare as sets: extra lines allowed, a missing one fails) and prints enforced: yes | no. The ruleset item is read only by the heartbeat workflow (the agents' deny list blocks ruleset reads in sessions); 'required': false tolerates no ruleset until the tech lead sets it true after the move (18 Nov).",
